From 2996d95cb81a494fefc069c088969cf7f2f149f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adhi <adhi@shinecraft.dev>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 07:04:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Payment Reminder & Company Invoice: resolve client
 contact info from live Clients module data

- Payment reminder (WhatsApp/email) and the new Company Invoice preview/PDF were pulling
  client phone/email/GST/address from a separate hardcoded CLIENT_DATABASE copy in
  clientHelper.ts, disconnected from the actual Clients module (clientService.ts).
- Any client added or edited via the Clients module was invisible to these features, so
  the reminder button stayed disabled ('no phone number available') and the new invoice
  design showed a blank client block for anyone outside the 5 original demo clients.
- Added useAllClients() hook (Clients module) as the single live source of client data.
- Rewrote clientHelper.getClientInfoByName to resolve against that live client list instead
  of a stale duplicate, keeping only the invoice/project -> company-name lookup maps for
  legacy demo records.
- Wired useAllClients() into PaymentReminderModal, InvoicePreviewModal, and
  generateInvoicePdf.ts (Export PDF button on Invoices list) so all three consumers stay
  in sync with the Clients module automatically.
